{"name":"Atmosphere","hex":"#0099dd","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"atmosphere","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The gases surrounding the Earth or any astronomical body.","The air in a particular place."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/atmosphere"}],"entries":[{"title":"Atmosphere","blocks":[{"text":"An atmosphere is a layer of gases that envelop an astronomical object, held in place by the gravity of the object. The name originates from Ancient Greek  ἀτμός (atmós) 'vapour, steam' and  σφαῖρα (sphaîra) 'sphere'. An object acquires most of its atmosphere during its primordial epoch, either by accretion of matter or by outgassing of volatiles. The chemical interaction of the atmosphere with a solid surface can change its fundamental composition, as can photochemical interaction with the host star. A body retains an atmosphere for longer durations when the gravity is high and the temperature is low. The stellar wind works to strip away a body's outer atmosphere, although this process is slowed by a magnetosphere. The further a body is from its star, the lower the rate of atmospheric stripping."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Top_of_Atmosphere.jpg/330px-Top_of_Atmosphere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atmosphere","wikidata":"Q8104"},{"title":"Atmosphere (group)","blocks":[{"text":"Atmosphere is an American hip-hop duo from Minneapolis, Minnesota, consisting of rapper Slug and DJ/producer Ant ; founding member Spawn left the group after the release of the group's first album Overcast!. With the exception of a few tracks on the album Lucy Ford, Ant has produced every Atmosphere record. Since its formation in 1996, the group has released thirteen studio albums and ten extended plays."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Atmosphere_8-17-2023_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Atmosphere_8-17-2023_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atmosphere_(group)","wikidata":"Q757508"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Protoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_%28Artist%27s_Concept%29_%282022-016%29.jpg/500px-Protoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_%28Artist%27s_Concept%29_%282022-016%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Protoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_%28Artist%27s_Concept%29_%282022-016%29.jpg/1280px-Protoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_%28Artist%27s_Concept%29_%282022-016%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Protoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_%28Artist%27s_Concept%29_%282022-016%29.jpg/500px-Protoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_%28Artist%27s_Concept%29_%282022-016%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Artist's impression of a newly-formed protoplanet","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AProtoplanet_Around_AB_Aurigae_(Artist's_Concept)_(2022-016).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Mars_general_circulation.png/500px-Mars_general_circulation.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Mars_general_circulation.png/500px-Mars_general_circulation.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Global atmospheric circulation on Mars during solstice","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMars_general_circulation.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Band_autographs_in_the_green_room_of_the_Harris_Center_at_Grinnell_College_01.jpg/500px-Band_autographs_in_the_green_room_of_the_Harris_Center_at_Grinnell_C